  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Infrastructure Adviser support to IET</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Infrastructure Adviser provides infrastructure advisory support across Pacific and Development Group (PDG&#x2019;s) activities, including those in Pacific Polynesia and French Pacific (PACPF), Pacific Melanesia and Micronesia (PACMM), and Global Development and Scholarships (GDS) divisions. Infrastructure advisory support covers the full cycle of infrastructure activities, from initiation to delivery.</narrative>
  </description>
